%% Data flow with trust boundaries from docs/threat-model.md.
flowchart TB
    subgraph TB1[Operator shell]
        ENV[environment credentials]
    end
    subgraph TB2[Scanner process]
        COL[collectors]
        HOOK{allowlist hook}
        RED[evidence redaction]
        ENG[engine and scoring]
    end
    subgraph TB3[Cloud API]
        API[AWS or Moto]
    end
    subgraph TB4[Local disk]
        DB[(findings store)]
        RPT[reports and manifest]
    end
    ENV -->|read once, never logged| COL
    COL -->|Describe, List, Get| HOOK
    HOOK -->|allowed| API
    HOOK -.->|blocked write| X[error]
    API -->|configuration| COL
    COL --> ENG --> RED --> DB --> RPT
